WEBVTT

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.070
Takao and the team start to panic with their match against the scientists on the horizon.

00:01:35.070 --> 00:01:41.450
Takao tries to win by modifying Dragoon and
Rei suggests that we forfeit the match outright.

00:01:41.450 --> 00:01:45.830
The two of them argue, and Rei leaves.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:49.460
The next morning, Rei
unexpectedly comes back to us.

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.050
It might be that Kai
got him back on board,

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:54.670
but I don't think
that's the whole story.

00:02:03.510 --> 00:02:06.060
Whoa, is this Dragoon?

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:08.520
It's totally different now!

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.230
Yeah, I asked Kyoujyu to do
it and he finally finished.

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.820
I made modifications
to its basic structure.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:18.740
It has never been
tuned up this far.

00:02:19.110 --> 00:02:22.830
There's no way I could
lose with this thing!

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.250
Takao...

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.210
Let's test this baby out!

00:02:30.210 --> 00:02:31.710
Watch and learn!

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:33.170
Go, Shoot!

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.550
That's it!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:48.310
I expanded the Attack Ring's
angle and increased the

00:02:48.310 --> 00:02:51.400
damage-dealing attack points to the opponent to its maximum level.

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:55.940
Additionally, I doubled the Weight Disk
and touched up the core components.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:00.610
Wait, those modifications
are beyond BBA regulations!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:02.780
I know it's against the rules!

00:03:03.450 --> 00:03:04.910
Step back and think about it!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:09.040
How badly we've been
treated by those scientists!

00:03:09.790 --> 00:03:14.210
We don't know what kind of underhanded
tactics they'll use to steal our Sacred Beasts!

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:18.010
We don't stand a chance
if we follow the rules!

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:22.430
There's no reason to believe that they'll follow the rules this time.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:24.220
But even so...

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.850
What's wrong with Dragoon?

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:42.240
Thank goodness.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.070
It just got scratched a little.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:48.700
I believe the rotation was unbalanced because you're not used to it yet.

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:52.620
Don't say it so casually!

00:03:52.620 --> 00:03:55.210
We only have two
days until our match!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.630
You're right...

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:00.170
Watch your language, Takao!
It was your fault, wasn't it?

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:02.590
You can't blame him for it!

00:04:02.590 --> 00:04:04.800
Why don't you just
sit down and shut up?

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:06.390
What did you say to me?!

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:07.680
Now, now...

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:10.520
That was rude!
You owe Hiromi an apology!

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:12.020
Why should I?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:13.900
That's enough, Takao.

00:04:14.190 --> 00:04:17.860
I know you're panicking because our
match with Kane's team is coming up.

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:21.110
But you've been acting like a
completely different person lately!

00:04:21.110 --> 00:04:21.780
Huh?

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.570
He's right. You're not
acting like you usually do!

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.700
What's with you all?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:33.500
The old Takao would
have never modified his

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:36.540
precious Dragoon beyond recognition.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:43.340
I don't think you'll improve by
needlessly modifying Dragoon.

00:04:43.340 --> 00:04:45.050
I agree.

00:04:45.050 --> 00:04:46.260
But...!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.390
No matter how low
our opponents go,

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:51.560
there's no reason for us
to go as low as them.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:54.940
Takao, remember the
world championships.

00:04:54.940 --> 00:05:00.230
We fought against strong Bladers
and became the best in the world.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:05.400
No matter how strong they were, we took them on the way we always have, right?

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.530
Isn't that how we
became world champions?

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:11.200
Now is the perfect
time to remember that.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.790
Take a deep breath and think.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.370
Takao...

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:19.500
You guys just don't get it!

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:23.760
What I've had to feel to
get this to this point...

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.550
Takao...

00:05:27.090 --> 00:05:28.140
Takao!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:34.020
This is one match...

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:36.810
This is one match
I can't afford to lose.

00:05:36.810 --> 00:05:39.360
If I lose, that's that.
And then...

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:51.240
Seiryu!

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.050
Kane... I will beat you,
no matter what!

00:06:20.190 --> 00:06:22.150
Two more days to go!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.610
I'm itchin' for a battle!

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:28.110
Today we will do our final adjustments to the digital Sacred Beasts in battle. Got it?

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.860
Now you're speaking my language!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:34.450
I'm completely bored with battling against the virtual simulations.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.660
Kane and Salima.

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.960
Your digital Sacred Beasts lack growth.

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:43.840
Train them until our matches begin.

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.420
Doctor.

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:52.350
In order to defeat the
BBA team, Kane and I

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:55.010
only intend to master
the digital Beyblades.

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:57.980
We do not intend to rely
on a Sacred Beast to battle.

00:06:57.980 --> 00:06:59.230
What did you say?

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:02.060
Salima, are you still
on about that crap?

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:06.820
Are you not ashamed as a Blader to be
so desperate to develop a Sacred Beast?

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:08.440
Why you!

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.530
Back off.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.240
Don't provoke them. We just
have to battle like we always have.

00:07:13.240 --> 00:07:14.080
But...

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.790
We decide how we battle.

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:19.080
If we win, there's
nothing to complain about.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:23.540
You won't be singing that
tune for much longer.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:32.470
Doctor, we're ready to go.

00:07:33.680 --> 00:07:36.680
As our first battle...

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:37.600
Kane!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.310
You're up.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:41.020
Sure.

00:07:41.020 --> 00:07:42.810
Bring Cyber Dragoon!

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.360
Awright! I'll fight Kane!

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:51.070
No, me first!

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:55.450
No, his opponent will be Cyber Driger.

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.330
Don't hold back. You hear me?

00:08:06.380 --> 00:08:08.590
Give me everything
you've got, Salima.

00:08:08.590 --> 00:08:10.800
Let's show them
how we battle!

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.340
I will fight you
fair and square.

00:08:13.340 --> 00:08:15.680
Without relying on
some Sacred Beast!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:17.300
Let's get started!

00:08:17.300 --> 00:08:19.930
Three! Two! One!

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:22.180
--Go, Shoot!
--Go, Shoot!

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:25.310
Go, Cyber Dragoon!

00:08:25.980 --> 00:08:27.690
Cyber Driger!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:33.450
Most impressive.

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:38.830
It's pushing back!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.450
It's absorbing the damage
with its subtle movements.

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.960
Cyber Driger ain't half bad!

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:49.130
Mr. Gideon.

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:52.630
Are these two still
trying to keep their style?

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:57.390
Yes, but it shouldn't be long before they're
drawn in by the might of our digital Sacred Beasts.

00:08:57.390 --> 00:08:59.970
Please watch to your heart's content.

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.100
Go!

00:09:08.520 --> 00:09:10.320
Is that all you've got?

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.780
Go, Dragoon!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:17.740
You're good, Kane.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:20.330
Salima! Summon Cyber Driger!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.290
Kane! Use Cyber Dragoon!

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:24.870
Quiet! I don't need my Sacred Beast!

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.170
Jim! Goki! Watch how we battle!

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:36.300
Yell all you want
but remember this.

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:40.600
You can't escape the power
of the digital Sacred Beasts.

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.390
Driger!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:50.560
You're soft, Kane!

00:09:51.230 --> 00:09:53.480
Are you trying to get under my skin?

00:09:56.700 --> 00:09:59.030
The Sacred Beasts are coming out!

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:02.280
Both Sacred Beast indexes will
soon reach critical rotation!

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:06.370
Yes! When their spirits
reach their highest level,

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:07.920
will be exactly when...!

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:09.580
Dragoon!

00:10:10.630 --> 00:10:12.710
Driger!

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.510
Dragoon!

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:23.510
Kane, no!

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:30.980
This is an amazing battle...

00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:39.030
Their gauges are rising rapidly!

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:41.820
Very good, Dragoon, Driger!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:03.300
Kane! Salima!

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:04.640
Are you okay?

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.900
Doctor, let me battle again.

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:16.030
I want my Cyber Dragoon to evolve!

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.530
As do I.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:20.950
My Cyber Driger should
be stronger than this.

00:11:22.110 --> 00:11:24.870
Yes, battle as
much as you need.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.580
The rest is up to you.

00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:35.210
Sir!

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:47.010
Reporting in.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:12:02.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:04.950
Reporting in.

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:10.040
Our plan to obtain the four Sacred Beasts has entered the final stage.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:16.710
This time for sure... You have my word that Kane and his friends will deliver.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:18.500
Keep it up.

00:12:18.710 --> 00:12:22.930
With the power of the digital Sacred Beasts, everything should satisfy your expectations.

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:24.970
I await good news.

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:25.800
Sir.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:43.400
Dammit! Again?

00:12:43.780 --> 00:12:49.240
No good. No matter how many times he tries, Takao can't bring out all of Dragoon's power.

00:12:49.240 --> 00:12:51.290
What's gotten into you, Takao?

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.420
This never happened before!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:56.670
He's getting worse...

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.800
He's in a rut.
At this rate...

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:02.720
Can't we do something?
The match is tomorrow!

00:13:02.720 --> 00:13:03.970
Hey, Kai!

00:13:04.430 --> 00:13:07.800
Our only option is to
return Dragoon to normal.

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.260
But that's only
if Takao's up for it.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:12.770
It's a little too late for that!

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:17.270
Crap... I have to keep battling
until I get back in the groove!

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.060
Max!

00:13:18.810 --> 00:13:20.020
Let's battle!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.400
Again?

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:26.070
This is bad.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:31.200
If he battles like that, those scientists
are gonna eat him for lunch!

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:34.000
And then this time the
four Sacred Beasts will--

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.960
They'll be stolen for
sure this time. But...

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:41.050
If I walk up and warn
him I doubt he'll listen.

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.090
What do we do then?

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.130
What's the fuss?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.260
You two!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:53.810
Because of our one little slip up, Takao's
gone and done something crazy to Dragoon.

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.560
They do some really dumb
stuff. I can't believe it.

00:13:57.560 --> 00:14:01.860
There's only one way to
get Takao out of his rut.

00:14:01.860 --> 00:14:04.530
So hurry up and spill it then!

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:12.160
Huh? Where's Takao?

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.330
Beats me.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.000
I think he wants to be alone.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.210
I think he's meditating
to prepare for tomorrow.

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:23.920
Takao would usually
never even consider that.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:26.260
He's really got his
back against the wall...

00:14:26.670 --> 00:14:29.300
Max, it's our last chance to train.

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:32.550
The two of us need to
fight with all we've got.

00:14:32.550 --> 00:14:33.760
Okay!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.520
Wait, are you two
fine with that?

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:37.180
Huh?

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:41.190
Even when your own teammate
is struggling so hard!

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:45.940
That's cold! Is that how the BBA team rolls after fighting across the world together?

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.450
Hiromi, even so...

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.530
I just don't get it...

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.620
Hiromi!

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.630
Takao!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.210
Hiromi, Kyoujyu...

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:08.880
What are you doing out here?

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:10.880
Getting all depressed
by your lonesome.

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:12.550
How pitiful.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:15.640
Shut up! I don't wanna
hear that from you!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:17.560
If you want to cool off,

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:21.350
why don't you just dive
headfirst into that river?

00:15:22.480 --> 00:15:24.900
Why don't I throw you in?!

00:15:24.900 --> 00:15:27.820
Look at that, you've got
enough energy to get mad.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.070
Takao.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.120
Ozma.

00:15:35.120 --> 00:15:37.370
Tomorrow's finally the day, huh?

00:15:37.370 --> 00:15:39.000
What do you want?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.460
I've got something to say to you.

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.830
You can't beat the Psykicks!

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:45.420
What?

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:47.590
And what makes you say that?

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.550
You've lost sight of yourself.

00:15:50.550 --> 00:15:54.680
The pressure of facing strong
enemies has changed you.

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.890
You're trying to fight
with a different Dragoon.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:16:00.520
You don't stand a chance.

00:16:01.690 --> 00:16:05.810
Damn you... did you come all
this way just to say that?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.940
I came here to beat you!

00:16:08.900 --> 00:16:10.780
To beat me?

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:16.910
You--no, the entire BBA team will
be completely decimated by Psykick.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.490
But, Kinomiya...

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:22.210
I will crush you...

00:16:23.120 --> 00:16:24.880
Right here and now!!

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:27.380
Takao, you shouldn't face him!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.050
Sounds good to me!
Stop your yapping and let's get it on!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:33.340
Bad news for you, but Dragoon's
a little different this time!

00:16:34.470 --> 00:16:35.640
Get ready!

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:37.100
Go, Shoot!

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:47.230
And this just had to happen
the day before our match...

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:49.190
Go, Dragoon!

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:53.110
It's not over yet!

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:54.660
The battle has just begun!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:55.950
Takao!

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:58.950
He's fighting Ozma?

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:01.080
Stop!

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.040
Takao!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.010
Stay out of this one.

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.220
Shut him down, Ozma!

00:17:16.340 --> 00:17:18.430
Say your prayers, Kinomiya!

00:17:18.430 --> 00:17:19.260
Darn...

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:21.140
If this keeps up, Dragoon--

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:21.970
Is in big trouble!

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:23.270
Back off, Takao!

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:27.560
You're kidding! My upgraded
Dragoon should never lose to Ozma!

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:31.020
Pay attention, guys!

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.740
Watch Dragoon as it
crumbles to a pitiful end!

00:17:33.740 --> 00:17:36.490
Go, Flash Leopard!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:43.830
His Sacred Beast!

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.290
Alright! I'll use mine, too!

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.130
Seiryu!

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.130
Takao, you're gonna get beat!

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:55.130
N-no way!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:57.220
Seiryu!

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:03.220
Wait, what's happening?

00:18:03.560 --> 00:18:04.890
Can I just not see it?

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.390
No, Seiryu isn't coming out!

00:18:07.390 --> 00:18:10.690
What's happening?
Why won't Seiryu come out?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:14.570
Look at that! It's because you
went and modified Dragoon!

00:18:14.570 --> 00:18:16.400
How unfortunate.

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.700
Seiryu!

00:18:18.280 --> 00:18:19.620
Finish him off!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:22.200
Cross Fire!

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:38.010
How is Dragoon?!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.890
Takao, look...

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.180
What a disgrace.

00:18:46.180 --> 00:18:47.640
Well, Kinomiya?

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:50.100
Just like I said, isn't it?

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:52.940
Why didn't Seiryu come out?

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.150
Don't you get it?

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:58.070
It's because you changed!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:19:00.240
What do you mean?

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:04.160
If you fought fairly
like you always do,

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:07.160
Seiryu would have
responded to your call!

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.750
That's crazy! I'm always--

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:13.670
I know it's against the rules!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:17.550
We don't stand a chance
if we follow the rules!

00:19:18.880 --> 00:19:20.430
I get it...

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.590
That must be it...

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:27.060
After trying to change Dragoon and my shooting style...

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.520
After obsessing over all that...

00:19:29.520 --> 00:19:32.400
I really had changed.

00:19:32.400 --> 00:19:34.520
Which is why Seiryu...

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.690
Takao...

00:19:35.900 --> 00:19:37.110
Max.

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:38.490
Rei.

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:39.740
Kai.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.820
You guys were right all along.

00:19:43.950 --> 00:19:46.030
I was a fool.

00:19:47.740 --> 00:19:51.620
Kyoujyu. Please return
Dragoon back to normal.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:52.870
Takao...

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.710
I'll go back to normal, too.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:58.340
And tomorrow, I'll
fight like I always have.

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:02.050
Yeah! Now I feel
like you can do this!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:06.510
Leave it to me! If there's no problem with the parts, I can have it done right now!

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:11.350
That boy's a handful.

00:20:12.980 --> 00:20:14.020
Wait.

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:20.650
This battle was all to get
Takao back on track, wasn't it?

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.240
Maybe.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.660
Guys, I'm sorry!

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:33.330
If I had listened to you guys,
none of this would have happened.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:38.090
All good. It's kinda weird
to see you so honest.

00:20:38.090 --> 00:20:39.090
Max...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:43.470
You asked earlier how we
became world champions.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.180
I finally remembered.

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:47.640
I believed in my friends.

00:20:47.640 --> 00:20:52.020
Seiryu and I fought those battles
together with our hearts as one.

00:20:52.980 --> 00:20:54.100
Takao...

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:57.440
Done! Dragoon is back to normal!

00:20:57.690 --> 00:21:00.730
Okay! I made up my mind!

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:04.240
I'll show 'em how we battle!

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.910
Takao Kinomiya is back in action!

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:09.030
Go, Shoot!

00:21:10.370 --> 00:21:12.700
Go, Dragoon!

00:21:22.090 --> 00:21:23.550
Seiryu...

00:22:59.810 --> 00:23:02.690
Our battle against Kane's
team has finally begun.

00:23:02.690 --> 00:23:05.900
The match in the Battle Tower,
Psykick's home base.

00:23:05.900 --> 00:23:08.610
The whole place is crawling
with traps and schemes!

00:23:08.610 --> 00:23:11.240
It's very scary! Very terrifying!

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.660
Kane... Cosign... Tangent...

00:23:13.660 --> 00:23:14.950
Chairman?

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:16.910
Hey, stay awake!

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:18.710
Max will be in big
trouble next episode!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:20.290
Don't miss it!
